ype":"paragraph","text":"実は私が言い間違えちゃったのを気にしていたら、スタッフさんがTAKE2を撮ってくれてたんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たださっき何でTAKE2の方を使ってくれなかったのかを聞いたら。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"TAKE1の方がややこしく考えず、いつもの私らしく話せていたからなんだそうです(._.)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の天然さはお決まりの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『生温かく』見守っていただけると助かりますm(_ _)m"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして長々とお喋りしてしまい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんすいませんでした～‼‼‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメント録画中、一緒に聞いていた若月に「長い長い(笑)」と言われて気づいたのですが、その時既に手遅れでしたorz"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！乃木どこ？での浴衣‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/08/20/9020315/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/08/20/9020315/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/reika.sakurai/img/blog/reika.sakurai/img/2013/08/20/9020315/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年は赤い大輪の花だったので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は淡い水色の薔薇を選んでみました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","t